
## .gitignore（同步适配code、dataset文件夹）
```gitignore
# ========== C语言编译产物 ==========
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.out
*.exe
tdvrp
build/
obj/

# ========== Python 缓存 ==========
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# ========== 输出图片、日志、临时结果 ==========
output/*.png
output/*.jpg
output/*.pdf
output/*.log
output/*.txt

# ========== 数据集（大数据文件不上传仓库） ==========
dataset/*.txt
dataset/*.csv

# ========== VSCode远程ssh相关缓存 ==========
.vscode/
.idea/

# ========== 系统文件 ==========
.DS_Store
